{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114125","id":3111236055,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc65cbHX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114125/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114125/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/01ebbfc191c212ea9893b6800ddb2b22ef177226","number":114125,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ktx/ktx2 resource loader: support loading sRGB textures as compressed; support non-2D texture resources","user":{"login":"BenLubar","id":4257305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4257305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar","html_url":"https://github.com/BenLubar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"(Massively simplifying this pull request upon further inspection.)\r\n\r\nImplements parts of: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13660\r\n\r\nIt looks like Godot doesn't currently make any distinction between sRGB and linear *textures* but rather assumes that all albedo textures are sRGB sent to the GPU as linear and converted in the shader and all non-color textures are linear sent as linear.\r\n\r\nWhich means that the ktx decoder doesn't need to differentiate between them either - ktx textures that are encoded as sRGB are likely going to be used in contexts where Godot already expects sRGB and ktx textures that are encoded as linear are likely going to be used in contexts where Godot already expects linear color.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes detection of ASTC HDR in the ktx decoder.\r\n\r\nThis pull request also makes it so that the ktx/ktx2 resource format loader (but not yet any other entrypoint into the API) supports 2D array, cubemap, cubemap array, and 3D textures in addition to its already-supported 2D texture decoding.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","ava